        "eyebrow": "Hello there",
        "name": "I'm",
        "name_second": "Camila.",
        "text": "<p>Maybe a friend sent you a clip from the show, or you found the pricing worksheet late one night with a quote you did not know how to send. Either way, I am glad you are here.</p><p>I ran an interior design studio for ten years. The design was the easy part. Pricing, saying no and getting home before nine took me much longer, so now I teach exactly that.</p>",
